#. なぁ、苗木っち…
#. 俺は思うんだけどよ…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hey, Makoto. You know what I think?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺と苗木っちがこうして出会ったのは、
#. 単なる偶然じゃねーんじゃねーかな？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You and me meeting like this? It wasn't a coincidence."
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、苗木っちには朗報だ！
#. 俺の好意で超格安に占ってやんべ！！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So I've got some good news for you! I'm gonna give you\n"
"a psychic reading at a huge discount!"
msgstr ""

#. …超格安？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A discount...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>２時間１０万円<CLT>のところを、
#. 特別価格で<CLT 3>９万円<CLT>にしてやる！！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Normally it's <CLT 3>a thousand bucks<CLT> for two hours. But\n"
"for you? Let's call it <CLT 3>nine hundred<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. １万円しか割り引いてくれないの！？
#. て言うか、高過ぎるよ！！
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's only a hundred-dollar discount! And even then\n"
"it's way too expensive!"
msgstr ""

#. コラコラ…<CLT 3>“超高校級の占い師”<CLT>に占ってもらうのは、
#. ものすごーく、ありがたい事なんだぞ。
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, come on! You should count yourself lucky that the\n"
"<CLT 3>Ultimate Clairvoyant<CLT> is willing to tell your future!"
msgstr ""

#. …そんなに当たるの？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...So are you right pretty often?"
msgstr ""

#. 当たるべ！
#. どんな事でも<CLT 3>２０％の確率でぴったり的中<CLT>だべ！
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I sure am! At the bare minimum, I've got a <CLT 3>20% chance\n"
"of accuracy<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２０％って…ビミョーだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>20%? That sounds pretty sketchy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. コラコラ、ビミョーそうな顔すんな…
#. ちゃんと聞いてなかったんか？
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"For real? Don't make that face! Didn't you hear what I\n"
"said!?"
msgstr ""

#. “どんな事”でも、２０％の確率で、
#. “ぴったり”当たるんだぞ？
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "20% of the time I'm right, every time!"
msgstr ""

#. 天災だろうと事故だろうと選挙の結果だろうと、
#. どんな事でもだぞ！？
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That includes natural disasters, election results, you\n"
"name it!"
msgstr ""

#. わかんねーのか？　それの凄さが！
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Don't you realize how amazing that is!?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. よっしゃ、いいだろう！
#. じゃあ、試しに占ってやんべ！！
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, fine! I'll give you a special trial run!"
msgstr ""

#. というか、すでに占っているぞ！！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"After all, I've already seen what the future has in\n"
"store for you!"
msgstr ""

#. え！？　いつの間に！？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!? When did you see it!?"
msgstr ""

#. ふっふっふ…驚きの未来が見えたべ…
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Heh heh heh. You won't believe what I saw..."
msgstr ""

#. オメーの子供と俺の子供は、
#. 母親が一緒らしいぞ！！
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It would appear that the mother of your children, and\n"
"the mother of *my* children, are the same woman!"
msgstr ""

#. 嫌だよっ！　絶対に！！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I refuse! Denied! Don't like it!"
msgstr ""

#. 嫌とかそういう問題じゃねーって…
#. これは占いだかんな。
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter if you don't like it! That's just the\n"
"way it is."
msgstr ""

#. …２０％の確率？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...20% accuracy, you said?"
msgstr ""

#. そういう事だべ。
msgctxt "0024 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "At least."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ぜ、絶対に外れて欲しい！
#. 頼むから外れて欲しい！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I-I pray to everything holy that you're wrong! Please,\n"
"be wrong!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、今のはお試しコースだから、
#. 特別価格は適用されねーぞ。
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Now then, since that was a special trial run, I'm\n"
"afraid I can't apply the discount."
msgstr ""

#. １０万円の振り込みを頼むべ！
#. ここから出た後でいいからよ！！
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That'll be one thousand dollars, please! Don't worry,\n"
"you can pay me after we get outta here."
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…ちょっと待ってよ…！
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Wait, hold on—!"
msgstr ""

#. ていうか、当たらないよね！？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But there's no way you're gonna be right, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだったら、占ってやろうか？
#. 今の占いが当たるかどうかをよ！
msgctxt "0030 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"If you like, I can do a reading right now to see\n"
"whether my reading was right or not."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、料金は発生すっけどな！
msgctxt "0031 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Naturally, additional fees will apply!"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハ！　考えといてくれや！
#. 占って欲しくなったら、すぐ言えよ！！
msgctxt "0032 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Think about it, okay? Let me know as soon as you're\n"
"ready for my services! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>行っちゃった…けど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh...he's gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>貯金あるかな…もう１回分の料金…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Do I have enough in my bank account to take another\n"
"crack at it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …って駄目だ！
#. お金なんか払っちゃ駄目だ！！
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...No! I can't bring myself to pay for something like\n"
"that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>危ない…こうやって罠にはまっていくのか…
#. とは言え…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can see how people could fall into that kind\n"
"of cycle, though. That was close...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お願いだから絶対に当たらないで欲しい。
#. さっきの占いだけは…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Please, whoever's listening, I'm begging you...\n"
"Whatever else happens, don't let him be right...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>葉隠康比呂の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“長考”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Lost in Thought<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと別れた後、
#. ボクは、いったん自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
